1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
ovspatialquery tests candidate placements.
Exact box-overlap queries power movement, rotation and the landing guide.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,000
Game rules remove completed rows.
ovstage publishes versioned scene updates for the renderer.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,800
ovrtx renders the result on the GPU.
RTX shading, reflections and bloom bring the blocks and effects to life.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,000
Queries + scene updates + rendering.
Python coordinates the game; each library has a focused responsibility.
